      "details": "[i][color=#00ffff][youtube]l2SQMxboYgc[/youtube]\n<br />I downscaled the images which is shown here because I can able to upload max file size of 8MB in nexus site. The every screenshot which I taken from game is almost around 15MB to 20MB.[/color]\n<br />\n<br />[/i][color=#00ff00]Also the screenshots were taken from the game in 4K Widescreen Ultra Graphics.\n<br />[/color]\n<br />[b][color=#ffff00][size=6][u]INSTALLATION PROCEDURE:[/u][/size][/color]\n<br />[/b]\n<br />Uninstall if there is already installed Reshade. Because my graphic preset has custom effects.\n<br />\n<br />Download this Graphics Preset file.\n<br />\n<br />Extract the files into the game root Directory[color=#00ffff][i][i]\n<br />[/i]\n<br />[/i][/color]That it Guys...\n<br />\n<br />Launch game and [color=#00ff00]Enjoy!!![/color] by playing the game with this awesome Preset.\n<br />\n<br />Reshade Menu Show / Hide → [i][color=#00ffff]Delete\n<br />[/color][/i]Toggle Effects On /OFF → [i][color=#00ffff]End\n<br />\n<br />[/color][/i]To uninstall Just delete the files which you extracted in the game folder.\n<br />- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - \n<br />\n<br />\n<br />If you need any help, feel free to contact me.\n<br />\n<br />[b][color=#ffff00]Discord →[/color] [/b][url=https://discord.gg/uBTutBA8VX]https://discord.gg/uBTutBA8VX\n<br />[/url]\n<br />[color=#ffff00][b]Youtube →[/b][/color] [url=https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCezpxT8MM-BtYze0aaiiNog]Gamer JP\n<br />\n<br />[/url]Thanks,\n<br />[color=#00ff00][size=5][b]JP[/b][/size][/color]",
