    "description": "NEXT GEN RTGI PRESET",
    "details": "[color=#ffff00][size=6][b]RTGI PRESET - SLEEPING DOGS DEFINITIVE EDITION\n<br />[/b][/size][/color]\n<br />[b][size=3]Totally there are below 3 Presets [/size][/b](Refer the screenshots for best comparison)\n<br />\n<br />[list]\n<br />[*][color=#00ffff][size=4][b]RTX OFF[/b][/size][/color]\n<br />[*][color=#00ffff][size=4][b]RTX OFF + MXAO ON[/b][/size][/color]\n<br />[*][color=#00ffff][size=4][b]RTX ON[/b][/size][/color]\n<br />[/list]\n<br />\n<br />[b][color=#00ff00][size=4]RTX OFF :[/size][/color][/b] For Low end PC. It is a best color grading preset for the entire game... You can play the game with the preset to feel the different experience.\n<br />\n<br />[b][color=#00ff00][size=4]RTX OFF + MXAO ON :[/size][/color][/b] For Low / Medium End PC. It is the same exact preset but adds detailed Ambient Occlusion to the game to make it feel like Remastered edition.\n<br />\n<br />[b][color=#00ff00][size=4]RTX ON :[/size][/color][/b] For Medium / High End PC. It included the above two effects as well as Ray Tracing Effects.\n<br />\n<br />[b][color=#6d9eeb][u]Note :[/u][/color][/b] The [b]RTX ON[/b] effects were still in testing because I don't have a proper GPU to test these effects.... If you face any issues please let me know...\n<br />\n<br />- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - \n<br />\n<br />[b][size=6][u][color=#ffff00]INSTALLATION P[/color][b][color=#ffff00]ROCEDURE :[/color]\n<br />[/b][/u][/size][/b]\n<br />Install Reshade (You can use latest version)\n<br />\n<br />Copy the preset file to the game installation directory\n<br />[color=#00ffff][i]([b]\"[/b][b]C:&#92;Program Files (x86)&#92;Steam Client&#92;steamapps&#92;common&#92;SleepingDogsDefinitiveEdition\"[/b])\n<br />\n<br />[/i][/color]Download [url=https://www.patreon.com/mcflypg]RTGI[/url] [b][color=#ffd966][i](only applicable for RTX ON Preset)[/i][/color][/b]\n<br />\n<br />[color=#f4f4f4]Copy the [/color][b]RTGI Shader + Texture[/b][color=#f4f4f4] to the reshade-shaders Folder [/color][b][i][color=#ffd966](only applicable for RTX ON Preset)[/color][/i][/b]\n<br />\n<br />Launch game and [b][color=#00ff00]Enjoy!!![/color][/b] by playing the game with these awesome Presets.\n<br />\n<br />- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - \n<br />\n<br />If you need any help, feel free to contact me.\n<br />\n<br />[b][color=#ffff00]Discord →[/color][/b] [url=https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa1hiRzZMWjR5M3ZsanJpY29BdFI3WTFfX3E0Z3xBQ3Jtc0trU2kyanRDQ0k1ZDNMSkJPZW9JVmQ5S2lvT2MxX3pZUkpYNWhhOE9tWXJ3VFQ5eVREeUE1SU9jZ0N2WFI5UXJpTXBPQXRsa1U2cVQ4QnhpTlBwLVV2eTNHRHg4Rk9ITVpoZTBZU0M5UmpkNTVEUVlQRQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fdiscord.gg%2FuBTutBA8VX&amp;v=0yVgCEN_U3Y]https://discord.gg/uBTutBA8VX\n<br />[/url]\n<br />[b][color=#ffff00]Youtube →[/color][/b] [url=https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCezpxT8MM-BtYze0aaiiNog]Gamer JP\n<br />\n<br />[/url]Thanks,\n<br />[b][color=#00ff00][size=5]JP[/size][/color][/b]",
