      "details": "This mod replaces the below files in the Original Game\n<br />\n<br />1. Copyright Screen (PS5 Wolverine Game Concept)\n<br />2. 20th Century Fox Intro\n<br />3. Marvel Video (Replace with Logan Movie Marvel Intro video)\n<br />4. Logan Jacket into Marvel Wolverine RED Shirt (PS5 Wolverine Game Concept)\n<br />5. Play all levels with Marvel Wolverine Costume\n<br />6. Loading Screen (PS5 Wolverine Game Concept)\n<br />7. Splash Image (PS5 Wolverine Game Concept)\n<br />8. Use Reshade to Tweak the Color (In Progress - Beta)\n<br />\n<br />[u]Installation Steps :[/u]\n<br />\n<br />[u]General Steps:[/u]\n<br />1. Copy the files from [b]Copy to Documents Folder[/b] and paste it in your [b][i]Documents Folder[/i][/b]. (Unlock Ultra Texture)\n<br />2. Copy the files from [b]Copy to Game Folder[/b] and paste it in your [b][i]Game installed directory[/i][/b]. (Backup If you wish - Replace)\n<br />3. Download and open [b][i]Texmod 0.9[/i][/b]. Select the Wolverine.exe and then choose Marvel Wolverine v1.0.tpf file\n<br />4. Install this Mod to fix unwanted effect [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/xmenoriginswolverine/mods/1]Remove Silly Effects and Toggle HUD[/url]\n<br />\n<br />[u]For Reshade (Optional):[/u]\n<br />For this game I modified reshade files into Scripts, because this is a Direct X9 Game. This is because there are other mods which uses same dll file as reshade dll. So, I changed it into script so you can use many Direct X9 mods simultaneously\n<br />\n<br />1. Copy the files from Reshade - Copy to Game Folder and paste it in game installed director.\n<br />Press Delete Button to enable Reshade Menu\n<br />Press End Button to Toggle On / OFF Effects.\n<br />Enjoy!!!!\n<br />\n<br />- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - \n<br />\n<br />\n<br />If you need any help, feel free to contact me.\n<br />\n<br />[b][color=#ffff00]Discord →[/color][/b] [url=https://discord.gg/uBTutBA8VX]https://discord.gg/uBTutBA8VX\n<br />[/url]\n<br />[b][color=#ffff00]Youtube →[/color][/b] [url=https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCezpxT8MM-BtYze0aaiiNog]Gamer JP\n<br />\n<br />[/url]Thanks,\n<br />[b][color=#00ff00][size=5]JP[/size][/color][/b]",
